  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif ceorlisc man geþeo, þæt he hæbbe V hida landes to cynges utware, 7 hine man ofslea, forgilde man hine mid twam þusend þrimsa.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a ceorl prospers, that he has five hides of land on which he discharges the king's dues, and anyone kills him, he is to be paid for with 2,000 thrymsas.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gif ceorlisc man geþeo, þæt he hæbbe V hida landes to cynges utware, 7 man hine ofslea, forgylde man hine mid II þusend þrymsa.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if a layman prospers so that he possesses five hides of land for his obligations to the king and anyone kills him, compensation for him shall be two thousand thrymsas.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
